<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112784" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠτουργ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tending plants</i> or
				<i>trees,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. δένδρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Secund.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			: as Subst., <i>planter, gardener,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἱεροὶ Ἀπόλλωνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			 (Epist.Darei), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.255
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.2b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>begetting, generating,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατὴρ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					592
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ φ. πατρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1482
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ φ.</span> (without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατήρ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				481
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυτουργὸς Θέτιδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IA</u>
					949
				</span></i>
			; in later Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατέρα καὶ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.83a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>creator, author,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				597d
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
